{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261018/photo/bkn-20261018171328519-1018_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261018213803\"/><p>失蹤男子何霆軒。</p><p>33歲男子何霆軒，10月2日上午於粉嶺聯興街一帶最後露面後便告失蹤，其家人前日(16日)報案。</p><p>何霆軒身高約1.8米，體重約90公斤，肥身材，圓面形，黃皮膚及蓄黑短髮。他最後露面時身穿黑色短袖上衣及黑色短褲。執法部門呼籲，任何人如有該失蹤男子的消息或曾見過他，請與調查人員聯絡。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T13:58:57.621408+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T09:13:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T15:17:49.855908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T13:57:58.504578+00:00","content_hash":"ea3d4dfbad0d403bf4610d23c8ed165c9246698a023e00e9b5be6d0afc361522","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}